   "pdf_object_id": "text:44",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "的下一章“延迟补偿技术”，其中我们研究了游戏",
   "bbox": [
    184.79,
    196.89,
    409.44,
    211.55
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 11,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    184.79,
    480.1,
    409.44,
    494.76
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:45",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "开发人员发明的各种技术，用于应对和补偿互联网的延迟和数据包丢失特性。多人",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    211.18,
    413.7,
    225.85
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 12,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    465.8,
    413.7,
    480.47
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:46",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "在线游戏面临的一个基本问题是每个玩家经历的延迟很少是相等或恒定的。然而，",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    225.48,
    413.7,
    240.14
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 13,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    451.51,
    413.7,
    466.17
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:47",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "为了保持公平和真实的沉浸式体验，游戏必须适应、预测和调整这些不同的延迟。",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    239.78,
    413.7,
    254.44
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 14,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    437.21,
    413.7,
    451.87
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:48",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "我们研究客户端技术，例如客户端预测和对手预测，以及服务器端技术，例如时间",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    254.07,
    413.7,
    268.74
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 15,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    422.91,
    413.7,
    437.58
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:49",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "扭曲。引入网络数据包压缩作为减少网络引起的延迟的一种方法。",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    268.37,
    342.22,
    283.03
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 16,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    408.62,
    342.22,
    423.28
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:50",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "我们的下一章“可玩性与网络条件和作弊”将采取不同的视角。我们研究网络状",
   "bbox": [
    56.04,
    308.66,
    413.45,
    323.33
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 17,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    56.04,
    368.32,
    413.45,
    382.99
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:51",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "况和作弊这两个独立的问题如何影响玩家对游戏体验的满意度。首先，我们研究了",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    322.96,
    413.7,
    337.62
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 18,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    354.03,
    413.7,
    368.69
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:52",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "解玩家对任何特定游戏类型的延迟容忍度的重要性。这些知识可以帮助游戏托管公",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    337.25,
    413.7,
    351.92
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 19,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    339.73,
    413.7,
    354.4
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:53",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "司估计他们满意的客户将来自地球上的哪个地区（以及在哪里放置新服务器以覆盖",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    351.55,
    413.7,
    366.21
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 20,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    325.44,
    413.7,
    340.1
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:54",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "新市场）。我们讨论该领域的现有研究以及尝试自己建立该知识时需要考虑的问题",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    365.85,
    413.7,
    380.51
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 21,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    311.14,
    413.7,
    325.8
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:55",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "。接下来我们看看沟通模型、作弊和作弊缓解措施。作弊行为在网络游戏中很普遍",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    380.14,
    413.7,
    394.81
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 22,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    296.84,
    413.7,
    311.51
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:56",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "，因为此类游戏将竞争性与匿名感结合在一起，而匿名性会导致人们对自己行为的",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    394.44,
    413.7,
    409.1
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 23,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    282.55,
    413.7,
    297.21
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:57",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "责任感减弱。我们研究可能针对您的游戏尝试的服务器端、客户端和基于网络的作",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    408.74,
    413.7,
    423.4
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 24,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    268.25,
    413.7,
    282.91
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:58",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "弊示例，并讨论检测和阻止作弊的技术。",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    423.03,
    229.89,
    437.7
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 25,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    253.95,
    229.89,
    268.62
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:59",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "在“宽带接入网络”中，",
   "bbox": [
    56.04,
    465.5,
    168.37,
    480.17
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 26,
