    168.96
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:74",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "然后，我们在“玩家来自哪里以及何时？”这一章中朝着完全不同的方向前进。",
   "bbox": [
    56.04,
    549.98,
    413.45,
    564.65
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 31,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    56.04,
    127.0,
    413.45,
    141.67
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:75",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "游戏托管公司面临的关键问题之一是确定他们的市场存在于哪里、他们的玩家是谁",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    563.77,
    413.7,
    578.43
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 32,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    113.22,
    413.7,
    127.88
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:76",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "以及他们居住在哪里。这会对您的服务台需要运行的时区以及进出服务器的游戏流",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    577.55,
    413.7,
    592.22
   ],
   "font": "SourceHanSerifCN-Regular",
   "font_size": 10.21,
   "color": 0,
   "line": 33,
   "page": 25,
   "block_type": 0,
   "v3_bbox": [
    46.08,
    99.43,
    413.7,
    114.1
   ]
  },
  {
   "pdf_object_id": "text:77",
   "operator": "TJ",
   "text": "量的潮起潮落产生影响。我们采取一个非常实用的方向，首先讨论如何自己监控和",
   "bbox": [
    46.08,
    591.34,
    413.7,
    606.0
